      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَافُّوهُمْ</span></b>  (S, MA, O,K) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى القِتَالِ</span> (S, O, K)
<i>They fought them in rank; they drew themselves
out in a rank against them</i> [<i>in fight</i>]. (MA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
[And app. one says also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَافَّهُ</span> meaning <i>He had the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُفَّة</span> <i>of his house over against,</i> or <i>facing, his</i>
(another's) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُفَّة</span>. See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ مُصَافِّى</span>, below.]

